#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""V49 — Raw-BANC Mushroom-Body Synaptic Memory.

Block A tests the actual BANC PN→KC→MBON alignment as a bounded plastic
synaptic-memory substrate against KC-ID, degree-rewire, weight-shuffle and
binary-support controls. Block B then tests raw non-self MBON recurrence against
matched recurrence controls, without changing the KC→MBON learning rule.

No slots, object traces, APL, PAIR, learned routing, replay, or DAN mechanism.
The graph is embedded from the supplied BANC v888 Feather files.

Mac M3 examples:
  python3 elm_v49_raw_banc_mb_core.py --self-test
  caffeinate -dimsu python3 elm_v49_raw_banc_mb_core.py --stage all --workers 4 --out-dir v49_results
  caffeinate -dimsu python3 elm_v49_raw_banc_mb_core.py --stage A --workers 4 --out-dir v49_results
"""
